{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Agent sessions are not carried across a restart. Each one reappears on its next event.": {
      "comment": "Post-launch alert detail: why the island shows no agent sessions yet.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent sessions are not carried across a restart. Each one reappears on its next event."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aracı oturumları yeniden başlatma sırasında taşınmaz. Her biri bir sonraki olayında yeniden görünür."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last time, KerNotch quit itself because CPU stayed high after three restarts. Report: %@": {
      "comment": "Post-launch alert after the watchdog quit the app.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last time, KerNotch quit itself because CPU stayed high after three restarts. Report: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch son çalışmasında üç yeniden başlatmaya rağmen CPU yüksek kaldığı için kendini kapattı. Rapor: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch is restarting because CPU stayed high despite protective measures. A diagnostic report was saved.": {
      "comment": "Tier 2 watchdog notification: the app is relaunching itself.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch is restarting because CPU stayed high despite protective measures. A diagnostic report was saved."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch koruyucu önlemlere rağmen CPU yüksek kaldığı için yeniden başlatılıyor. Tanı raporu kaydedildi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch is using more CPU than expected. Animations are paused while it recovers.": {
      "comment": "Tier 1 watchdog notification: the island paused its motion to shed CPU.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch is using more CPU than expected. Animations are paused while it recovers."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch beklenenden fazla CPU kullanıyor. Toparlanana kadar animasyonlar duraklatıldı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch quit itself: CPU stayed high after 3 restarts within an hour. Diagnostic report: %@": {
      "comment": "Watchdog notification: the restart budget is spent, so the app quits instead of relaunching.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch quit itself: CPU stayed high after 3 restarts within an hour. Diagnostic report: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch kendini kapattı: bir saat içinde 3 yeniden başlatmaya rağmen CPU yüksek kaldı. Tanı raporu: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch restarted itself after sustained high CPU use. Report: %@": {
      "comment": "Post-launch alert after the watchdog restarted the app.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch restarted itself after sustained high CPU use. Report: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch sürekli yüksek CPU kullanımı sonrası kendini yeniden başlattı. Rapor: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit KerNotch": {
      "comment": "Status item menu: terminates the app.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit KerNotch"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch'dan Çık"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…": {
      "comment": "Status item menu: opens the settings window.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings…"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ayarlar…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start 10-Minute Timer": {
      "comment": "Status item menu: starts a ten-minute countdown.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start 10-Minute Timer"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 Dakikalık Zamanlayıcı Başlat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start 25-Minute Timer": {
      "comment": "Status item menu: starts a twenty-five-minute countdown.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start 25-Minute Timer"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "25 Dakikalık Zamanlayıcı Başlat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start 5-Minute Timer": {
      "comment": "Status item menu: starts a five-minute countdown.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start 5-Minute Timer"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 Dakikalık Zamanlayıcı Başlat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Timer": {
      "comment": "Status item menu: stops and clears the running timer.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop Timer"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zamanlayıcıyı Durdur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to KerNotch": {
      "comment": "The onboarding window's title bar. Lives in the app target's catalog rather than KerNotchUI's because the window is built by the composition root, which resolves against the main bundle.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to KerNotch"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch'a hoş geldiniz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not saved": {
      "comment": "Stands in for the report path when the diagnostics report could not be written.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "not saved"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "kaydedilmedi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch could not start listening for agent updates.": {
      "comment": "Alert title shown when the loopback listener for agent hooks fails to start.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch could not start listening for agent updates."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch, aracı güncellemelerini dinlemeye başlayamadı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent status will not appear in the notch until listening starts. Turn the agent off and on again, or restart KerNotch.": {
      "comment": "Alert detail shown when the loopback listener for agent hooks fails to start.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent status will not appear in the notch until listening starts. Turn the agent off and on again, or restart KerNotch."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dinleme başlayana kadar aracı durumu çentikte görünmez. Aracıyı kapatıp yeniden açın ya da KerNotch'u yeniden başlatın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch could not read its settings.": {
      "comment": "Launch alert title when settings.json exists but cannot be read.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch could not read its settings."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch ayarlarını okuyamadı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch is using default settings for now and will not save changes. Launch at Login, the app language and agent hooks are left exactly as they are. Check that this file belongs to you, then restart KerNotch: %@": {
      "comment": "Launch alert detail when settings.json cannot be read. Placeholder is the settings file path.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch is using default settings for now and will not save changes. Launch at Login, the app language and agent hooks are left exactly as they are. Check that this file belongs to you, then restart KerNotch: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch şimdilik varsayılan ayarlarla çalışıyor ve değişiklikleri kaydetmeyecek. Açılışta başlatma, uygulama dili ve ajan hook'larına dokunulmadı. Bu dosyanın size ait olduğunu kontrol edip KerNotch'u yeniden başlatın: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
